======================================================================
[ SuperSploit ] Sessions Management
======================================================================
Description:
  Manages active Command & Control (C2) agent connections.

Commands:
  sessions               List all active C2 sessions
  sessions -l            List all active C2 sessions
  sessions -i <id>       Interact with a specific session
  sessions -k <id>       Kill/Terminate a specific session

Example:
  sessions -i 1
======================================================================